Ung, C.-H., Bernier, P.Y., Guo, X.J. and Lambert, M.-C. 2009. A simple
growth and yield model for assessing changes in standing volume across
Canada's forests. The Forestry Chronicle 85(1): 57-64.
\doi{10.5558/tfc85057-1}

